# Line endings are part of this repository's deploy contract.
#
# supabase/functions/** is uploaded verbatim by `supabase functions deploy`,
# and the audit trail for these functions is a byte-for-byte comparison
# between the deployed bundle and the committed blob. This machine's global
# `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, so a fresh clone on
# Windows would deploy CRLF files that no longer match the blob they came
# from — silently breaking source/deploy reproducibility without changing a
# single line of code.
#
# Pinning eol=lf keeps the working copy identical to the blob everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
